libibuddy
------------------------------------------
Library to control your iBuddy device

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libibuddy-devel-0.0.3-1bl1
  libibuddy0-0.0.3-1bl1
  libusb1.0-1.0.21-1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libusb1.0-devel-1.0.21-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/rosorio/libibuddy

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/rosorio/libibuddy/archive/refs/tags/v0.0.3.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libibuddy-0.0.3-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libibuddy-0.0.3-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libibuddy-0.0.3-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libibuddy-0.0.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libibuddy0-0.0.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libibuddy-devel-0.0.3-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libibuddy)
  /usr/bin/ibuddy_test.exe
  /usr/bin/ibuddycmd.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libibuddy.README
  /usr/share/doc/libibuddy/Changes
  /usr/share/doc/libibuddy/README.md

(libibuddy0)
  /usr/bin/cygibuddy-0.dll

(libibuddy-devel)
  /usr/include/ibuddy.h
  /usr/lib/libibuddy.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libibuddy.pc

------------------

